  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築結構系統",
    "sub_ename": "STRUCTURAL SYSTEM IN ARCHITECTURE",
    "describe_ch": "藉由圖形及照片瞭解並說明建築的形式與結構系統的關係，並介紹結構系統的分類和個別差異性及應用。透過建築的情形並整合結構造型之美學與應用。預期學生有能力詮釋建築結構系統與設計規劃之能力創造合理之空間。",
    "describe_eh": "Through diagrams, the relationship between architectural forms and structural systems will be explained, and the classification of structure systems and their different characters also will be discussed. Through introducing the integrated built cases in architectural structure, the result of the course is the ability to apply the knowledge of structure system on the architectural design, and create the architectural forms with beauty and tension.",
    "pre_subname": "ENGS1006應用力學",
    "pre_sub_id3": "ENGS1006",
    "pre_sub_ename": "ENGS1006 APPLIED MECHANICS",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能認識建築結構系統的分類特性",
      "describe_en": "Know the classified characters of various structure systems in architecture."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能利用建築結構系統的類型，評估建築結構造型發展的可能性",
      "describe_en": "Use the patterns of structure system to evaluate the possibilities of structural form for building."
    }
  ],
